        "explanationTitle": "Uses and benefits of image-to-PDF",
        "formula": "each PDF page = one image (embedded at original resolution, no quality loss)",
        "explanation": [
          "Merging images into a PDF makes archiving, printing, and sharing easier than loose files. PDF wraps bitmaps in vector pages, preserving full clarity and rendering consistently across devices.",
